#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion-settings.md:8
msgid "伴侣配置分两层存储："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion-settings.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 层级                              | 内容                                                        | 存取                                          |\n"
"| --------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Hub PG**（`companion_profile`） | 行为、模型、动作库、槽位                                    | 设置 → Hub 服务 → 桌面伴侣；经 Hub RPC / HTTP |\n"
"| **本机**                          | 窗口显隐（`companion-shell` scope）、SAP 运行时状态（只读） | 设置 → 本机 → 桌面伴侣                        |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion-settings.md:15
msgid ""
"Sidecar 本地 `~/.anima/companion/config.json` 仅为 **hub-sync 缓存**，设置 "
"UI 不直接读写。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/companion-settings.md:16
msgid ""
"修改 Hub profile 后，sidecar 通过 `companion.sync.pull` 同步到本机；overlay "
"通过 `emitConfigChanged` 刷新。"
msgstr ""
